# Text files are checked out with LF line endings on every platform, whatever
# core.autocrlf says. A CRLF checkout breaks the shell scripts the containers run
# (`/bin/sh^M`) and the SQL migrations whose checksums schema_migrations holds.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
